    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12495" root="دره" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَرَهْرَهَةٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A shining,</i> or <i>brightly-shining, star,</i>
(AA, K, TA,) <i>that rises from the horizon glistening intensely.</i> (AA, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A woman who
overcomes,</i> or <i>subdues, her husband.</i> (AA, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِكِّينٌ دَرَهْرَهَةٌ</span> <i>A knife with a curved end;
called by the vulgar</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَلٌ</span>. (TA.)

